      "id": "993c88e7367d44e8",
      "line_num": 31,
      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [],
      "text": "**M1 \u2014 Shadow tree for merge base: Add `.project-finder/last-auto/<rel>/<note>.md` shadow mirror of the vault. After every successful emit, atomically write the freshly generated content to the shadow alongside writing it to the live file. The shadow is the `base` argument for 3-way merge on the next scan.**\n- [ ] Add `_shadow_path(output_path, vault_root)` helper computing the parallel path under `.project-finder/last-auto/`\n- [ ] After each successful emit, write the same content to the shadow path (mkdir parent on demand)\n- [ ] Atomic write via tempfile + rename so a crash mid-emit doesn't leave the shadow stale\n- [ ] Test: cold scan, verify shadow tree mirrors vault structure 1:1\n- [ ] Test: re-scan after editing a project, verify shadow updates with the new content\n\n`TODO.md:L31`",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 280,
      "x": 10,
      "y": 60
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "checked": false,
